        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WDH15, Double Wall Hooks</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this wall hook features double hook arms. Often used in bathrooms for hanging robes or towels. Also used in closets to hang belts, coats, and even purses. The Double Wall Hook can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"313\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-WDH15-size.gif?v=1704354512\" width=\"313\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WDH15 Wall Hook Size\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WDH15 Double Wall Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WDH15.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WDH15 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
